<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan weekly forex reserves dip to $1.182 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan weekly forex reserves dip to $1.182 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the weekly foreign exchange reserves holdings position in Pakistan in billions of dollars:</p>
<p>				DEC 26     DEC 19   DEC 28, '95</p>
<p> TOTAL			 1.182	 1.281    2.303</p>
<p> Forex in Pakistan	 0.409	 0.409    0.756</p>
<p> Forex outside Pakistan  0.084	 0.195    0.825</p>
<p> Gold coins and bullion  0.676	 0.676    0.707</p>
<p> Special Drawing Rights  0.013	 0.001    0.015</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
